Test data
  testdata/Osu_1hru and testdata/Ames_sub1 are the input files of the reference scenarios in the
  SWAT+ repository (refdata/), at the commit above, under the same license. Output files were
  left out.

Dependencies
  Every dependency offers a license compatible with LGPL-2.1-only (MIT, BSD, Boost, Unlicense or
  Unicode), and is used under that license when it is dual-licensed with Apache-2.0. Dependencies
  licensed only under Apache-2.0 are not used, because the Free Software Foundation considers
  Apache-2.0 incompatible with LGPL-2.1-only. For now there are no external dependencies at all.
